the Hariku Extension Exception. This template is not: it is under the MIT
License below, so you may copy it into an extension of your own and release
that extension under any license you choose, open source or proprietary.

The MIT License asks one thing: keep the copyright notice and the permission
notice below with any substantial part of the template that stays in your
extension. Code you write yourself is yours to license as you like.

